WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,560
Xiao Ou, take her to the operating room.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,560
Okay, Miss Astronomy, this way please

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:07,970
Why did this guy collect so much?

4
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:10,220
Fengse looks like a man now

5
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,220
Dear, is Huang Yan’s child arriving today?

6
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,220
Do you want to prepare anything else at home?

7
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:20,510
Your brother has to focus on his studies now and is very busy.

8
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:22,510
You may not have time to come back

9
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:28,510
School is on holiday. Where will he go if he doesn't come back?

10
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:29,510
It’s better to go back to my old home.

11
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,770
Well, you don’t need to prepare anything.

12
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,770
Don't talk too much to your children

13
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:33,770
So are you free recently?

14
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,770
Haoyan wants to go to the mecha amusement park

15
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:36,770
Pick a time this week

16
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:37,770
Not available this week

17
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:38,770
Haoyan wants to go, you take her there

18
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:40,770
So this year’s Huang Yan Day should be prepared as usual.

19
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,770
I have something else to do, I'll talk about it then

20
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:46,470
Mom, can I still see my brother in the summer?

21
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:48,470
Haoyan, do you really want to see your brother?

22
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,470
Why don't you have many friends?

23
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:52,470
But none of them are as powerful as their elder brothers.

24
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:53,470
Not as good-looking as my brother

25
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,470
But he is not your biological brother
